      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "content": "AI VOICE RECEPTIONIST (Retell → n8n) — POTATERRR SALON\n\n1. Retell posts call_analyzed to Webhook; ack 200 immediately.\n2. Filter drops call_started / call_ended / other events.\n3. Extract pulls caller, intent, service, slot.\n5. Bookable? checks intent + future slot.\n6. Calendar availability → create event → mark booked.\n7. Prepare row → call log → compose alert → Gmail.\n\nLIVE: Google Calendar booking, Sheets logging, Gmail alerts.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c5e8c279-45e8-4479-823f-6e2146d9d9cb",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Outcomes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        1696
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "4 OUTCOMES\n\n• booked — future slot, calendar free → event created\n• conflict — calendar says the slot is busy\n• no_booking — question, missing slot, or past slot\n• ignored — payload is not call_analyzed\n\nPast slot → no_booking.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bbf8e752-cc34-445d-b632-a26b4b40cf66",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Demo + Go Live",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        2048
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "GO-LIVE CHECKLIST\n• Retell: create agent + post-call analysis, subscribe webhook to call_analyzed.\n• Webhook: public HTTPS URL ending /webhook/voice-receptionist-n8n (Retell blocks localhost).\n• Calendar: connect Google Calendar OAuth2.\n• Gmail: connect Gmail OAuth2; sendTo = Config alert_email.\n\nDEMO PAYLOADS (simulator/)\n1 bookable → replace {{TOMORROW_1400}} with a future ISO slot\n2 question → no_booking\n3 past slot → no_booking\n\nRetell retries on timeout/non-2xx; Respond 200 acks immediately.\nThis archived Data Table variant has no dedupe guard; select a table in Log row to use it.\n\nHIPAA: public demo uses fake data only — not a covered deployment.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400
      }
    },
